request.body:
To {{source_name}},

I am a New Jersey resident. Under the New Jersey Data Privacy Act ({{citation}}), I request that you:

1. Delete all personal data you hold about me.
2. Stop selling my personal data, and stop processing it for targeted advertising and profiling.

Details to identify my record (please use them only for this request):
Name: {{full_name}}
Address shown on your site: {{address}}
Listing on your site: {{profile_url}}
Contact email for this request: {{email}}

The law requires a response within {{response_days}} days of receipt. Please confirm in writing when the deletion is complete.

Thank you,
{{full_name}}
{{date}}

followUp.body:
To {{source_name}},

On {{sent_date}} I sent you a request under the New Jersey Data Privacy Act ({{citation}}) to delete my personal data and stop selling it. The {{response_days}}-day response period ended on {{due_date}}, and I have not received a response.

Listing on your site: {{profile_url}}

Please complete the deletion and confirm in writing. If I do not hear from you, I will file a complaint with the New Jersey Division of Consumer Affairs.

{{full_name}}
{{date}}

